<title>HONG KONG: Earthquake felt off Indonesia.</title>
<headline>Earthquake felt off Indonesia.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake estimated at 6.1 on the open-ended Richter scale rocked an area near Ambon, Indonesia on Tuesday, the Royal Hong Kong Observatory said.</p>
<p>The quake, recorded at 3:48 a.m. Hong Kong time (1948 GMT Monday), had its epicentre in the Banda Sea about 40 km (25 miles) south-southwest of Ambon, the observatory said.</p>
